Basic Network Commands

ip addr – Show IP address
ip link – Show network interfaces
ifconfig – Display IP (old command)
hostname -I – Show system IP
hostnamectl – Show host details

📡 Connectivity Testing

ping host – Check connectivity
traceroute host – Trace network path
mtr host – Continuous traceroute
arp -a – Show ARP table

🔍 Port & Connection Checking

netstat -tulnp – Show open ports
ss -lntup – Show listening ports
lsof -i – Show port usage
nmap ip – Scan open ports

🌎 DNS Commands

nslookup domain – DNS lookup
dig domain – Detailed DNS info
host domain – Simple DNS query

📥 File Transfer

scp file user@ip:/path – Secure copy
rsync -avz – Remote sync
wget url – Download file
curl url – Test API / URL

🔐 Remote Access

ssh user@ip – Remote login
ssh-keygen – Generate SSH key
ssh-copy-id user@ip – Copy SSH key

🛠 Network Configuration

nmcli – Network manager CLI
route -n – Routing table
ip route – Show routes
ethtool eth0 – Network interface info
